sequenceDiagram
    participant Product as Product<br>[implements GapPeripheralResponse]
    participant CN as CN Peripheral<br>[implements GapPeripheral]
    participant Central as BLE Central

    Product->>CN: GapPeripheral.SetAllowPairing(false)
    Product->>CN: GapPeripheral.Advertise(type=advInd, advertisingInterval=160)
    CN-->>Product: GapPeripheralResponse.CurrentState(advertising)

    Note over Product, Central: SetAllowPairing(false) blocks new pairings.<br>Bonded centrals can still reconnect and re-encrypt.

    alt Connecting central has no bond
        Central->>CN: BLE connection request (no existing bond)
        CN--xCentral: Connection rejected
        Note over Product: No CurrentState(connected) callback fires.<br>Peripheral stays in advertising.
    else Connecting central is already bonded
        Central->>CN: BLE connection request (bonded central)
        CN-->>Product: GapPeripheralResponse.CurrentState(connected)
        Note over Product: Link re-encrypted using existing bond keys.<br>No new SMP procedure and no AuthenticationRequired.
    end
